"guideDescription" = "Please use the rear camera of your phone when shooting, and please adjust the position of your tongue to ensure that it is completely and properly placed in the core area of ​​the camera range.\n\nWhen shooting, be sure to ensure that the surrounding lighting environment is good, and avoid using lighting equipment that may cause interference from strange-colored lights. We recommend that you choose to shoot under natural light sources or white light sources to obtain the most realistic and detailed tongue image effects.\n\nWhen shooting, be sure to ensure that the surrounding lighting environment is good, and avoid using lighting equipment that may cause interference from strange-colored lights. We recommend that you choose to shoot under natural light sources or white light sources to obtain the most realistic and detailed tongue image effects.\n\nAt the same time, please carefully check to ensure that there are no foreign objects attached to the tongue, no abnormal color variation, and the tongue surface is kept fully stretched and flat, so as to obtain clear and comprehensive tongue diagnosis images.\n\nIt should be noted that since light exposure, camera angle, device performance and other factors may affect the results, the tongue diagnosis images provided by this function are for reference only. If you have any questions or need further diagnosis, it is recommended that you contact a professional Chinese medicine practitioner directly for consultation.";
